---
source: src/main.rs
expression: "render_help_snapshot(&[\"inbox\"])"
---
Create email inboxes and wait for the codes and links in their emails

Usage: hooklistener inbox [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  create       Create an email inbox and print its address
  list         List email inboxes for an organization
  list-emails  List the emails an inbox received, newest first [aliases: emails]
  show-email   Show an email with its code, link, and text [aliases: email]
  wait         Wait for an email to reach an inbox, then print it, its code, or its link
  help         Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help  Print help

Global options:
      --json               Output supported command responses or event streams as JSON
      --color <COLOR>      Styling policy for human output [default: auto] [possible values: auto,
                           always, never]
      --yes                Confirm destructive commands without an interactive prompt
      --log-level <LEVEL>  Log level [default: info] [possible values: trace, debug, info, warn,
                           error]
      --log-dir <DIR>      Directory for log files
      --log-stdout         Also write logs to stdout
